000200 IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
000300 PROGRAM-ID.          SRWREPRT.
000400 AUTHOR.              LYNN M BUNN.
000500 DATE-WRITTEN.        FEBRUARY 2, 1982.
000600*INSTALLATION.        GOODYEAR TIRE AND RUBBER - AKRON.
000700*REMARKS.
000800*
000900*D     TITLE: (R)ETURN OR (W)ITHDRAWAL REPRINT
001000*D     THIS SUBPROGRAM CREATES A REPRINT OF A RETURN OR
001100*D     WITHDRAWAL WORKSHEET.
001200*
001300*      ON MAY 3, 1982 THE PRINTER-NUMBERS WERE ADDED FOR
001400*      AKRON.  IF THE USERNAME IS MANAGER, THE PRINT-OUT
001500*      WILL GO TO PRINTER NUMBER 19.  LMB.
001600*
001700*      ON MAY 10, 1982, INSTRUCTIONS WERE ADDED; THE TITLE WAS
001800*      CHANGED; AND THE "NOW PROCESSING" MESSAGE IS PUT UP.  LMB.
001900*      COBOLII.
002000*
002100*      ON MAY 21, 1982, THE FLIP FLOP OPTION WAS ADDED FOR 2626A
002200*      TERMINALS.  ALSO, THE PROCESSING OUTLINE WAS ADDED TO THE
002300*      REMARK SECTION.  LMB.
002400*
002500*      ON JULY 9, 1982, THE DATABASE BUFFERS WERE UPDATED; THE
002600*      CWHO WAS REPLACED BY THE WHO INTRINSIC; AND THE MMIS LOGIC
002700*      WAS DELETED.  LMB.
002800*
002900*      ON JUNE 17, 1983, THE KSAM FILE WAS ADDED FOR THE
003000*      SPOOLER NUMBER.  LMB.
003100*
003200*      ON JANUARY 10, 1984, THIS PROGRAM WAS PUT INTO VIEW.  LMB.
003300*
003400*    ON MAY 16, 1985, CHANGED THIS SUBPROGRAM FOR THE
003500*    EUROPEAN DATE CONVERSION.  IT WILL NOW CALL "TDATECK2"
003600*    FOR ALL DATE MANIPULATION, WHICH WILL RESULT IN A
003700*    EUROPEAN STLYE DATE ON THE OUTPUT DOCUMENT IF THE
003800*    EUROPEAN DATE FLAG IS SET.
003900*    ALSO TOOK OUT KSAM LOGIC TO GET SPOOLER NUMBER AND
004000*    REPLACED WITH A CALL TO "TSPLPRT".  CIH.
004100*
004200*      09/26/85  ADDED CALLS TO FINDJCW, NLAPPEND, CATOPEN, AND
004300*                CATCLOSE IN ORDER TO ACCOMODATE THE NATIVE
004400*                LANGUAGE SUPPORT FACILITY.  ADDED LINKAGES AND
004500*                ALSO MADE THE CHANGE TO THE FORMFILE NAMES.
004600*      09/26/85  CHANGED ALL REFERENCES OF TSCRPRNT TO TSCRPRT2,
004700*                TDATECHK TO TDATECK2.
004800*                THIS WAS TO INCORPORATE THE NATIVE LANGUAGE
004900*                SUPPORT VERSIONS OF THESE SUBROUTINES.
005000*                                   -TW COTTON.
005100*
005200*
005300*    02/18/86
005400*      CHANGE THIS PROGRAM TO A SUBPROGRAM SO IT CAN BE CALLED
005500*      FROM STORES EXECUTIVE PROGRAM "TUDCSTR".  CIH.
005600*
005700 ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
005800 CONFIGURATION SECTION.
005900 SOURCE-COMPUTER.  HP-3000.
006000 OBJECT-COMPUTER.  HP-3000.
       SPECIAL-NAMES.  I-O-FEEDBACK IS I-O-FEEDBACK-AREA.
       INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
       FILE-CONTROL.
           SELECT DISPLAY-FILE
                  ASSIGN TO WORKSTATION-ZUDCSTR-SI
                  ORGANIZATION IS TRANSACTION
                  ACCESS IS DYNAMIC
                  RELATIVE KEY IS RELATIVE-RECNO
                  FILE STATUS IS DISPLAY-STATUS
                  CONTROL-AREA IS WS-CONTROL.

           SELECT DWLITEM
                  ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MCFLCS1501
                  ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
                    ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
                  RECORD KEY IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY
                    WITH DUPLICATES
                  FILE STATUS IS FILE-STATUS.

006300 DATA DIVISION.
