003700
       FD  DWLITEM
           LABEL RECORDS ARE STANDARD.
       01  DWLITEM-REC.
           COPY DDS-MCRPCS1500  OF MCFLCS1501.

006400 WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
006500
       01  RELATIVE-RECNO         PIC 9(9).

